      "role": "counsel",
      "is_accused": false,
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Thank you, Your Honour. This should be brief. I don't know if we're in open session or private session."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "speaker": "JUDGE KWON",
      "role": "judge",
      "is_accused": false,
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "I think we are now in open session."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "speaker": "MR. TIEGER",
      "role": "counsel",
      "is_accused": false,
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Out of an abundance of caution, maybe we could move into private session."
